# Architecture Overview

## Modules

### core/field.py
Spatial field representation and update rules.

### core/genome.py
Abstract genome `s` and mutation/selection dynamics.

### core/law.py
Law operator `E_s` derived from genome.

### core/intelligence.py
Field Intelligence functional measuring:
- stability
- adaptability
- redundancy
- persistence

### core/meta.py
Meta-equation updating genome and laws.

### engine/simulation.py
Main simulation loop.

### kernels/
Predefined kernel profiles:
- Armillaria
- Human
- Human2